  "description": "GUHREI crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C82 H161 Cr4 N9 O37 Sm4,2.5(C2 H3 N1),0.5(C1 H2 Cl2). From the CIF bond table, Sm1 (Sm) has 8 O neighbors; Sm2 (Sm) has 7 O neighbors; Sm3 (Sm) has 7 O neighbors; Sm4 (Sm) has 8 O neighbors; Cr1 (Cr) has 5 O neighbors; Cr2 (Cr) has 4 O neighbors; Cr3 (Cr) has 5 O neighbors; Cr4 (Cr) has 5 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 12 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.417-4.479 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 96.43-127.31°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C82H161Cr4N9O37Sm4·2.5MeCN·0.5CH2Cl2. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 3 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
